Supabase (self-hosting)
-----------------------
The database init files `db/01-roles.sql` and `db/02-jwt.sql` come from the Supabase self-hosting
project (github.com/supabase/supabase, docker/ folder), under the Apache-2.0 license.
`db/03-auth-owner.sql` and the gateway config (`gateway/nginx.conf.template`) are AuditForge's own.

The container images (supabase/postgres, supabase/gotrue, postgrest/postgrest, nginx,
axllent/mailpit) are pulled from their official registries and keep their respective licenses.

